        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>安全教育内容表</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      background: #d8d8d4;\n      color: #111;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 86%;\n      margin: 30px auto 10px;\n      transform: rotate(-0.25deg);\n    }\n    table {\n      width: 100%;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      table-layout: fixed;\n      background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n    td {\n      border: 1px solid #555;\n      padding: 4px 7px;\n      vertical-align: top;\n    }\n    .number {\n      width: 10.3%;\n      text-align: center;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      padding: 3px;\n    }\n    .content {\n      width: 89.7%;\n    }\n    .header td {\n      height: 26px;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      padding-top: 1px;\n      padding-bottom: 1px;\n    }\n    .r50 td { height: 58px; }\n    .r51 td { height: 48px; }\n    .r52 td { height: 78px; }\n    .r53 td { height: 50px; }\n    .r54 td { height: 51px; }\n    .r55 td { height: 56px; }\n    .r56 td { height: 50px; }\n    .r57 td, .r58 td, .r59 td, .r60 td, .r61 td, .r62 td, .r63 td, .r64 td { height: 31px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <table>\n      <tr class=\"header\">\n        <td class=\"number\"></td>\n        <td class=\"content\">报警</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r50\">\n        <td class=\"number\">50</td>\n        <td class=\"content\">下午放学后，教育幼儿要拉着大人走，不能自己到处跑，不能停留在幼儿园玩耍，以防意外。</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r51\">\n        <td class=\"number\">51</td>\n        <td class=\"content\">教育幼儿知道自己的姓名、园名、家长姓名、单位、家庭住址、电话，会表达清楚，紧急情况知道如何保护自己</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r52\">\n        <td class=\"number\">52</td>\n        <td class=\"content\">教育幼儿不随意轻信生人讲话，未经允许不跟陌生人走，更不要让陌生人碰自己的身体，告诉孩子，只有家长、医生、护士才能触摸他(她)的身体，如果陌生人要这么做，一定要尽快逃开。</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r53\">\n        <td class=\"number\">53</td>\n        <td class=\"content\">教育幼儿在家不自己动手反锁门，不玩煤气、炉火、火机、开水壶、饮水机、药品等危险物品。</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r54\">\n        <td class=\"number\">54</td>\n        <td class=\"content\">教育幼儿没人带领下不能自己过马路，过马路时，应遵守交通规则，走人行道，不在马路上停留和玩耍，上街走路靠右边走。</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r55\">\n        <td class=\"number\">55</td>\n        <td class=\"content\">教育孩子单独在家时，不随意开门，听到敲门声不要开门，可说：“我父母不在家，请你以后再来”，以防窃贼趁大人不在时闯入盗窃。</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r56\">\n        <td class=\"number\">56</td>\n        <td class=\"content\">到野外旅行或散步时不得随便采摘花果、抓捕昆虫，更不应该放入口内。以防意外。</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r57\">\n        <td class=\"number\">57</td>\n        <td class=\"content\">上放学时注意交通安全，慢行一看、二望、三听令。</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r58\">\n        <td class=\"number\">58</td>\n        <td class=\"content\">骑车学生注意不与机动车辆抢道，走人行横道，靠路右边走;</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r59\">\n        <td class=\"number\">59</td>\n        <td class=\"content\">注意道路和车辆信号，服从交通管理</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r60\">\n        <td class=\"number\">60</td>\n        <td class=\"content\">不穿越、攀登、跨越道路隔离栏</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r61\">\n        <td class=\"number\">61</td>\n        <td class=\"content\">不乘坐“三无”车辆，即不乘坐无车牌、无行驶证、无养路费行驶的机动车辆。</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r62\">\n        <td class=\"number\">62</td>\n        <td class=\"content\">不捡拾不明食物进食;</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r63\">\n        <td class=\"number\">63</td>\n        <td class=\"content\">注意传染源，发现病人及时治疗，与病人密切接触的要检查。</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r64\">\n        <td class=\"number\">64</td>\n        <td class=\"content\">饭前便后要洗手</td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
